      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Remon Lee is serving a life sentence without possibility of parole for first degree murder without ever having had a chance to present testimony from witnesses who could have established his innocence."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Bonnie I. Robin-Vergeer",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0000-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I would like to begin by discussing whether Lee's failure to comply with two Missouri rules governing motions for continuance is an adequate State law ground to bar consideration of Lee's Federal due process claim based on the State trial court's denial of a brief continuance."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: You're -- you're just summarizing now, I take it. You're going to go into more detail as to why --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Well, I -- I think it's fair to say -- or maybe it isn't. Maybe you can argue with this -- that what the appellate court was saying that at least under 24.10, there was an insufficient showing, and that's exactly what the trial judge found."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court record",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0001-0003",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 22,
        "start": 22
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "weren't subpoenaed until they got to Missouri. They came there voluntarily?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "He did not tell the judge that these witnesses could be located in a reasonable amount of time and that they would give the testimony that it has been suggested they would give."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
      "case_id": "2001-00-6933",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "03f04d4408c6652bcf5c65375827cdc22ea9a89875c425f4babd5c6a425e2f99",
      "evidence_id": "ev-03f04d4408c6-0002-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 41,
        "start": 41
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "QUESTION: Didn't -- didn't the lawyer announce it in his opening statement to the jury? Isn't that one reason it was so -- so prejudicial that they didn't show up?"
    },
